<section class="document-page">
<h2>Ownership scope and source notes</h2><p class="sandbox-label"><strong>Sandbox specimen</strong> · Fictional institution and customer data.</p><p class="document-reference">${facts.documentReference} · ${facts.issuedOn}</p>
<h2>Scope of this specimen</h2><p><strong>Certificate purpose:</strong> ${facts.certificatePurpose}.</p><p>The supplied account-holder snapshot records the listed holder as of the stated instant. A representative or permitted operator is not automatically an owner. The source service must verify the effective association and account identity; a matching customer name is insufficient. This illustration is not a signed legal certificate.</p><p>This document contains no balance assertion, guarantee, payment undertaking or statement of unrestricted account use. Current restrictions may change after the snapshot. An approved deployed certificate must identify the institution’s authority, disclosure purpose and verification channel, and retain exact source versions.</p><p>Illustrative authority reference: ${facts.issuerAuthorityReference}. Verification reference ${facts.verificationReference} is an internal sandbox identifier, not a public authentication service or QR verification endpoint.</p><h2>Referenced records</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.sources as row><tr><td>${row.resourceReference}</td><td>${row.version}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>

<div class="document-legal-note"><strong>Demonstration document.</strong> Firefly Sandbox Financial Services is a fictional demonstration entity. This is an unsigned sandbox specimen with fictional data, not an approved customer form, legal certification, audited report, signature or payment evidence. Approved institution details, source facts, product terms and jurisdiction wording require their own governed revision and authorization.</div>
</section>
